---

<BaseLayout
  title="About — Justin Rosengarten"
  description="Justin Rosengarten is a New York–based documentary director and editor making original films and branded storytelling."
  canonical="https://justinrosengarten.com/about"
>
  <main class="about">
    <StillsTimeline stills={stills} />

    <div class="copy">
      <p class="label">About</p>

      <p class="lede">
        Justin Rosengarten is a <span class="nowrap">New York–based</span> documentary
        director and editor making original films and branded storytelling.
      </p>

      <div class="body">
        <p>
          A graduate of the Rhode Island School of Design, he came back to film
          after a ten-year career in kitchens — including
          <a
            class="inline-link"
            href="/Press/Union%20Square%20Cafes%20Secret%20Weapon.pdf"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            data-press-open="press-usc"
          >a stint as the first-ever head bread baker at Union Square Cafe</a>, Danny
          Meyer's flagship and the birthplace of modern hospitality.
        </p>
        <p>
          The connection is craft: a dedication to process, patience, and paying
          attention — whether that's a fermenting loaf of sourdough or a
          marinating pile of footage. Across both, the goal is to capture and
          develop fleeting things, thoughts, and emotions&nbsp;… and present them
          whole.
        </p>
        <p>
          His short doc <a class="inline-link" href="/the-earthwalker"><em>The Earthwalker</em></a> is out now.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="details">
        <div class="detail">
          <p class="label">Credits</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Director</li>
            <li>Documentary Editor</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="detail">
          <p class="label">Contact</p>
          <ul>
            <li><a href="mailto:justin.rosengarten@gmail.com">justin.rosengarten@gmail.com</a></li>
            <li>New York, NY</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>

  <PressModal
    id="press-usc"
    title="Union Square Cafe's Secret Weapon"
    byline="Noah Rothbaum · February 22, 2017"
    pdf="/Press/Union%20Square%20Cafes%20Secret%20Weapon.pdf"
    pages={[
      { src: "/Press/union-square-cafe/page-1.jpg", width: 1600, height: 1268 },
      { src: "/Press/union-square-cafe/page-2.jpg", width: 1600, height: 1708 },
      { src: "/Press/union-square-cafe/page-3.jpg", width: 1600, height: 2099 },
      { src: "/Press/union-square-cafe/page-4.jpg", width: 1600, height: 2185 },
      { src: "/Press/union-square-cafe/page-5.jpg", width: 1600, height: 2726 },
      { src: "/Press/union-square-cafe/page-6.jpg", width: 1600, height: 2698 },
    ]}
  />
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 7fr 5fr;
    gap: 48px;
    align-items: start;
    padding: 100px 32px 64px;
  }

  .copy {
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    padding-top: 8px;
  }

  .label {
    margin: 0 0 12px;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.45);
  }

  .lede {
    margin: 24px 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(22px, 2.2vw, 30px);
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.92);
    max-width: 28ch;
  }

  .body {
    margin-top: 28px;
    max-width: 52ch;
  }

  .body p {
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.6);
  }

  .nowrap {
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .inline-link {
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
    transition: color 150ms ease, border-color 150ms ease;
  }

  .inline-link:hover {
    color: rgba(255, 220, 80, 0.85);
    border-color: rgba(255, 220, 80, 0.5);
  }

  .details {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) max-content;
    gap: 24px;
    margin-top: 32px;
    padding-top: 16px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
  }

  .details ul {
    list-style: none;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .details li {
    font-size: 12px;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
  }

  .details a {
    transition: color 150ms ease;
  }

  .details a:hover {
    color: rgba(255, 220, 80, 0.85);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
    }

    .lede {
      max-width: none;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about {
      padding: 68px 16px 48px;
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .details {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
